          "text": "dog",
          "pos": "noun",
          "role": "主语",
          "group": "np1"
        },
        {
          "text": "runs",
          "pos": "verb",
          "role": "谓语",
          "group": "vp"
        }
      ],
      "distractors": [
        {
          "text": "dogs",
          "pos": "noun",
          "role": "主语",
          "group": "np1"
        }
      ],
      "explain": "主语 dog 是单数，动词就得用 runs。选 dogs 的话主语变复数，动词要跟着变回 run。",
      "example": "The dog runs. → The dogs run.",
      "win": "你分清了：dog 是名词，作主语，位置在动词前面。"
    },
